{"timestamp":"2026-10-02T08:21:34.836Z","ordinal":12,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_04d65d5815a92a1b016abf698cd1b487d283ad269ba35b8545","status":"completed","call_id":"call_g24crUYrvFqI6tSsfa3Bdz4k","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat /private/tmp/clarify-task4-documents-20261002/case05/view-b/guide.md\",login:false,max_output_tokens:12000});text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0fbb4-3ac3-7f61-9fd6-6597ed960d01","create_time":1790929290.246006}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-02T08:21:35.352Z","ordinal":15,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a0fbb4-57f8-7d01-86d1-0442f2cd3a1c","call_id":"call_g24crUYrvFqI6tSsfa3Bdz4k","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"# Preparation defaults\nRestaurant owners can set one preparation time and override it for individual\nitems. This increment adds lookup and a snapshot: each new order stores the resolved\nminutes so later default changes cannot change it.\n\nWith a restaurant default of 15 minutes, an item with a missing or null prep_minutes\ninherits 15; an explicit zero stays 0. If the default becomes 20, the inherited\nitem's next lookup returns 20, the zero item stays 0, and an earlier order keeps 15.\n\nThe storage field is prep_minutes. effective_minutes resolves the current value;\ncreate_order copies it into a new order. Scheduling is outside this increment.\nThe product owner still needs to decide inheritance badges for the menu editor.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0fbb4-3ac3-7f61-9fd6-6597ed960d01","create_time":1790929295.352315}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-02T08:21:43.451Z","ordinal":20,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_04d65d5815a92a1b016abf6992cb7c87d2bf7fe88f3ecc911f","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"1. Owners need a restaurant preparation default with item overrides, while existing orders retain their original preparation time.\n2. With a 15-minute default, missing/null values resolve to 15 and explicit zero stays 0. Changing the default to 20 affects future lookups; an earlier order keeps 15.\n3. This increment adds current-value lookup through `effective_minutes` and order snapshots through `create_order`, using `prep_minutes` for storage.\n4. Scheduling remains outside this increment.\n5. The product owner must decide inheritance badges for the menu editor."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0fbb4-3ac3-7f61-9fd6-6597ed960d01","create_time":1790929295.819502,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_04d65d5815a92a1b016abf6992cb7c87d2bf7fe88f3ecc911f","turn_id":"01a0fbb4-3ac3-7f61-9fd6-6597ed960d01","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a0fbb4-779a-70a3-b5f7-85ec4a117a4c","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2}}
